{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37632","headline":"咏怀 · 郑谷","name":"咏怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迂疎虽可欺，心路甚男儿。\n薄宦浑无味，平生粗有诗。\n澹交终不破，孤达晚相宜。\n直夜花前唤，朝寒雪里追。\n竹声输我听，茶格共僧知。\n景物还多感，情怀偶不卑。\n溪莺喧午寝，山蕨止春饥。\n险事销肠酒，清欢敌手棋。\n香锄抛药圃，烟艇忆莎陂。\n自许亨途在，儒纲复振时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}